From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iwinfo: mtk: gate BE/EHT capability by chip and complete L1/devices HW IDs

Only expose IWINFO_80211_BE and IWINFO_HTMODE_EHT* for Wi-Fi 7 chips (MT799* or mtk_hwifi);
gate off EHT modes on Wi-Fi 6 chips (MT7981/MT7986/MT791*) using L1 profile, UCI phy, and sysfs.
Complete mtk_get_hardware_id_from_l1profile() and devices.txt entries for MT7981/MT7986/MT7993/MT7996.

